      <text><![CDATA[The functions f and g are defined as follows<p>\(\displaystyle f:x \rightarrow 5x-6 \)<br></p><p>\(\displaystyle g:x \rightarrow \frac{2x}{x+{@hh@}} \)<br></p><p><span style="color: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: 16px;">Write down the value of \(x\) which must be excluded from the domain of g&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span><br></p><p>\( x= \) [[input:ans4]] [[validation:ans4]]&nbsp;[[feedback:prt4]]<br></p><p style="text-align: right;"><br></p><p>Work out the <b>exact</b> value of&nbsp;</p><p>\( gf({@dispdp(ii,1)@}) = \)[[input:ans5]] [[validation:ans5]]&nbsp;[[feedback:prt5]]<br></p><p style="text-align: right;"><br></p><p><span style="color: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: 16px;">Solve the equation&nbsp;\( g(x) = 3\)&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span><br></p><h5><span style="font-weight: normal;"><p>\( x= \) [[input:ans6]] [[validation:ans6]]&nbsp;[[feedback:prt6]]</p><p style="text-align: right;"><br></p><p><span style="color: inherit; font-family: inherit;">\(g^{-1}(x) = \) [[input:ans7]] [[validation:ans7]][[feedback:prt7]]</span></p><p style="text-align: right;"><br></p></span></h5><h5 style=""><span style="font-weight: normal;"><p></p></span></h5><br><p></p>]]></text>
